hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"89","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere sath hum ne sham ki, tere sath subah ki, tere sath jeete hain, tere sath marte hain; teri hi taraf thikana hai. [Sham ka zikr]"
"90","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tu hi mera Rab hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin; Tune mujhe paida kiya, main tera banda hun; bhar-sak tere ahad aur wade par hun; kiye ki burai se teri panah chahta hun; mujh par teri nemat ka iqrar karta hun, apne gunah ka iqrar karta hun; mujhe bakhsh de; tere siwa gunah koi nahin bakhshta. [Sayyidul-istighfar; subah-sham padhe]"
"91","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main ne subah ki; Tujhe, tere arsh uthane walon ko, tere farishton ko aur teri sari makhluq ko gawah banata hun ke Tu hi Allah hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin, akela, beshareek; Muhammad tere bande aur rasul hain. [Char bar padhe; sham ko sham ke andaz mein]"
"92","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujh tak ya teri makhluq mein se kisi tak jo nemat pahunchi—woh sirf teri taraf se hai, tera koi shareek nahin; tareef teri hi hai, shukr tera hi hai. [Subah ka zikr; sham ko sham ke andaz mein]"
"93","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mere jism mein mujhe aafiyat de; ae Allah! Meri samaat mehfooz rakh; ae Allah! Meri basarat mehfooz rakh; tere siwa koi mabud nahin. Ae Allah! Main kufr aur faqr se teri panah chahta hun; qabr ke azab se teri panah chahta hun; tere siwa koi mabud nahin. [Teen bar padhe]"
"94","[AI-translation] Allah mujhe kafi hai; us ke siwa koi mabud nahin; usi par bharosa kiya; wahi arshe-azeem ka Rab hai. [Saat bar padhe]"
"95","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main duniya-aakhirat mein teri maafi aur aafiyat mangta hun. Ae Allah! Mere deen, duniya, ahal aur maal mein teri maafi aur aafiyat mangta hun. Ae Allah! Mere aib dhaanp de, mere darr se aman de. Ae Allah! Mujhe aage, peeche, daayein, baayein aur upar se mehfooz rakh; neeche se achanak pakad se teri azmat ki panah chahta hun."
"96","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Ghaib-hazir ke janne wale, aasmanon-zameen ke paida karne wale, har cheez ke Rab aur malik! Main gawahi deta hun ke tere siwa koi mabud nahin; apne nafs ke shar se, shaitan aur us ke jaal ke shar se, apne upar burai karne ya kisi musalman tak pahunchane se teri panah chahta hun. [Subah-sham padhe]"
"97","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se—jis ke naam ke sath aasman-zameen mein koi cheez nuqsan nahin deti; wahi sunne wala, janne wala hai. [Teen bar padhe]"
"98","[AI-translation] Rab ke taur par Allah se, deen ke taur par Islam se, nabi ke taur par Muhammad se main razi hun. [Teen bar padhe]"
"99","[AI-translation] Ae zinda, ae qayam rakhne wale! Teri rahmat se madad chahta hun; mere sare kaam sanwar de; palak jhapakne tak bhi mujhe mere hawale na kar."
"100","[AI-translation] Hum ne subah ki, badshahat bhi Rabbul-aalamin Allah ke liye subah hui. Ae Allah! Is din ki bhalai mangta hun: us ki fatah, madad, nur, barkat aur hidayat; is mein jo shar aur baad mein jo shar us se teri panah chahta hun. Hum ne sham ki, badshahat bhi Rabbul-aalamin Allah ke liye sham hui. Ae Allah! Is raat ki bhalai mangta hun: us ki fatah, madad, nur, barkat aur hidayat; is mein jo shar aur baad mein jo shar us se teri panah chahta hun."
"101","[AI-translation] Hum ne Islam ki fitrat par, ikhlas ke kalime par, hamare Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke deen par, aur hamare walid Ibrahim ki millat par subah ki, yaksu musalman hokar; aur woh mushrikon mein se na the."
"102","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai aur tareef usi ki hai. [Sau bar padhe]"
"103","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. [Subah sau bar ya susti ke khilaf ek bar, ya das bar padhe]"
"104","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai aur tareef usi ki hai, us ki makhluq ki tadad ke barabar, us ki zaat ki raza ke barabar, us ke arsh ke wazan ke barabar, aur us ke kalimaat ki siyahi ke barabar. [Subah teen bar padhe]"
"105","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main Tujhse faidemand ilm, pakeeza rozi aur qubul hone wala amal mangta hun. [Subah padhe]"
"106","[AI-translation] Main Allah se maghfirat chahta hun aur us ki taraf tauba karta hun. [Din mein sau bar padhe]"
"107","[AI-translation] Allah ke kamil kalimaat ki panah chahta hun us ki makhluq ke shar se. [Sham teen bar padhe]"
"108","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hamare Nabi Muhammad par salat wa salam bhej. [Das bar padhe]"
